Memoir of a Snail is a animation, drama, comedy film directed by Adam Elliot.

3
00:16:35,294 --> 00:16:41,294
Forcibly separated from her twin brother when they are orphaned, a melancholic misfit learns how to
find confidence within herself amid the clutter of misfortunes and everyday life.

