10
00:55:17,647 --> 00:55:23,647
Memoir of a Snail is a 2024 Australian adult stop-motion animated
tragicomedy film written, produced and directed by Adam Elliot.

11
01:00:49,411 --> 01:00:55,411
It stars the voices of Sarah Snook, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Eric Bana, Magda Szubanski,
Dominique Pinon, Tony Armstrong, Paul Capsis, Nick Cave, and Jacki Weaver.

12
01:06:21,176 --> 01:06:27,176
The film's plot, which is loosely inspired by Elliot's own life, follows the trials and
tribulations in the life of lonely misfit Grace Pudel, from childhood to adulthood.

13
01:11:52,941 --> 01:11:58,941
The film had its world premiere at the 2024 Annecy International Animation Film Festival on 10
June 2024, and was released in Australia by Madman Entertainment on 17 October 2024.

14
01:17:24,705 --> 01:17:30,705
The film received critical acclaim and was nominated for Best Animated Feature at the 97th Academy Awards, the
second R-rated animated film to be nominated after Anomalisa (2015), another stop-motion film.

15
01:22:56,470 --> 01:23:02,470
The film explores themes of depression, difficult childhood,
death of father, stop motion, foster family.

16
01:28:28,235 --> 01:28:34,235
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
